# Optional. Everything else is keyless.
#
# Text chat works with no environment variable: sign in with a free OpenRouter
# key in the app (stored in localStorage, sent only to openrouter.ai). Replies
# are routed through OpenRouter's free-model router (`openrouter/free`).
#
# GEMINI_API_KEY is a host key for the deployment. When present it keeps the
# search-grounded bio lookup, image avatars/sketches, and Neural Voice Link
# available at no cost to the user. When absent those features fall back to
# procedural generation (avatars/sketches) or the OpenRouter text path.
GEMINI_API_KEY=
